      "content": "that's a bit of a weird way to put it. you're saying their logic is fallacious and that they're basically misquoting engineers? it sounds like you're saying their side doesn't really have a valid point to stand on. if i'm trying to pitch this to a city council, am i right to just ignore those 'fallacies' and focus on the housing numbers instead?",
